comment = "Hardware-assisted execution tracing (Intel PT)"

desc = <<EOD
bsdtrace captures every branch a program takes using Intel Processor
Trace via the hwt(4) framework, then decodes the trace into
symbolized control-flow events (calls, returns, jumps, syscalls)
with per-function profiles, call trees, and flame-graph output.
Traces are saved for offline analysis.
EOD
